Third-party software used by the server
---------------------------------------
None of this is included in this repository. Docker downloads it when you build the
server image on your own computer, and it stays under its own licence.

- WhisperLive base image (ghcr.io/collabora/whisperlive-gpu): WhisperLive is under the
  MIT License above. The image also contains faster-whisper, CTranslate2, PyTorch and
  their dependencies, each under its own licence.
- nvidia-cublas-cu12 and nvidia-cuda-nvrtc-cu12 (server/requirements.txt): proprietary
  NVIDIA licence, not free software. The licence text comes inside each package
  (License.txt). https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-zone

Models the server downloads when you ask for them, not included either:

- Whisper models in faster-whisper format (by default Systran/faster-whisper-small):
  MIT License, https://huggingface.co/Systran/faster-whisper-small
- SMALL100 translator (alirezamsh/small100): MIT License,
  https://huggingface.co/alirezamsh/small100
- Any other model you add from Hugging Face or a direct link stays under its own licence.

Development only (tools/requirements.txt, not part of the extension or the server):
Pillow (MIT-CMU), to draw the icons.
